# ADDITIONAL VENDOR BUILD PROPERTIES
#
# GammaOS: re-enable 32-bit app support on this device (was zygote64 = 64-only).
# zygote64_32 starts the 32-bit secondary zygote so armeabi-v7a apps/emulators run.
# Requires the system build to NOT set ro.zygote.disable_secondary=1.
